{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13207030","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13207030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1320703001:0":{"text":"久しぶりの手紙だからか、姉さんったら一気に便箋を二十枚も書いてきたんですよ。","source_cn":"我好一阵子没收到莱卡的信了，这次她一口气写了二十页信纸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5889D288C9B411C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320703002:0":{"text":"今朝、旅館の前にいたら、手紙を届けに来たハトがふらふらで、危うく温泉に落ちそうになってたんです。","source_cn":"早上我站在旅馆门口，看见送信的鸽子跌跌撞撞飞过来，差点...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x713D5134EF7933C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320703003:0":{"text":"てっきり獣に襲われたのかと思ったら、どうやら手紙が重くて上手く飛べなかったようで……","source_cn":"我还以为它在路上被野兽袭击了，结果是信件太重，把它累得够呛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x738001AD22C41255","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1320703003":{"text":"てっきり獣に襲われたのかと思ったら、どうやら手紙が重くて上手く飛べなかったようで……","source_cn":"我还以为它在路上被野兽袭击了，结果是信件太重，把它累得够呛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x738001AD22C41255","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320703004:0":{"text":"なんでも、少し面倒なことが起きたせいで、手紙を書く時間がなかったそうです。","source_cn":"她说遇到了一点麻烦，所以一直没时间给我写信。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC8EC6B654D27B5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_fema